<block><txt break.before="1">An Act relating to administrative actions taken
by Commonwealth authorities or officers of the Commonwealth under certain
State laws relating to corporations.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bdb41af1-c9ab-4945-a94f-3b75d1c56e71"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_ac5493d1-1c61-46df-aad1-42d2d54dfa17"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-2001-033"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Corporations
(Administrative Actions) Act 2001</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8a671104-5a09-4eb6-bb22-486a46fe67fc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_66a5c472-115d-4579-a50a-ae646eb9fffb"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences immediately before the <legref
jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Corporations
Act 2001</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth, as originally enacted, comes
into operation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d22457f7-32e0-4f57-ad32-04435ba53bd0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_cd06379f-e66b-43cc-ad75-386ad4f4ca7e"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_972d86f2-f7a9-48eb-abff-c9cc8673472d"
id="def.administrativeaction"><b><i>administrative action</i></b></defterm>
means an act or omission of an administrative or legislative nature, and
includes any act or omission of an administrative nature that is done or
omitted in the course of or ancillary to or preliminary to or subsequent to
judicial proceedings (civil or criminal).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_582892d5-0989-4828-a13b-a36f275755b3"
id="def.commencementtime"><b><i>commencement time</i></b></defterm> means the
time when this Act commences under section 2.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_e2e59d39-cc0e-4cf9-8785-b6b2cdf14260"
id="def.Commonwealthauthority"><b><i>Commonwealth authority</i></b></defterm>
means an authority or body (whether incorporated or not) that is established
or continued in existence by or under an Act of the Commonwealth, but does not
include the Federal Court of Australia or the Federal Circuit and Family Court
of Australia.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_bd923d63-7e4c-40ba-9ee9-7a033078b7f9"
id="def.confer"><b><i>confer</i></b></defterm> includes impose.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_835e1121-7792-4e14-a682-f87e734e6925"
id="def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a
duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_7e8e0acc-3872-4257-aec7-3defc6a23850"
id="def.invalidadministrativeaction"><b><i>invalid administrative
action</i></b></defterm> means an administrative action of a Commonwealth
authority or an officer of the Commonwealth taken, or purportedly taken, at or
before the commencement time&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ef760001-75b7-4d8d-b2ce-2989b687fb6f" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">pursuant to a function or power conferred, or
purportedly conferred, by or under a relevant State Act (the <defterm
type="definition" guid="_b6fb4dd9-efea-41bd-813c-f48f63a9b9a4"
id="sec.3-def.relevantfunction"><b><i>relevant function</i></b></defterm> or
<defterm type="definition" guid="_350d1b4e-a7e6-471c-8889-ebfbbd37d328"
id="sec.3-def.power"><b><i>power</i></b></defterm>), and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fad25423-b001-4422-9078-a77c5ae1f0df" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in circumstances where the relevant function or
power could not have been conferred on the authority or officer by a law of
the Commonwealth the operation of which in the relevant respect was based on
the legislative powers of the Parliament of the Commonwealth (including, for
example, circumstances where the authority or officer was, or purportedly was,
under an express or implied duty to perform the function or exercise the
power),</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">that was invalid because of the circumstances referred
to in paragraphs (a) and (b), whether or not it was also invalid on any other
ground.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_be01471b-a3bb-4822-8239-7824d4bf9e14"
id="def.liability"><b><i>liability</i></b></defterm> includes a duty or
obligation.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b6a5d97f-b2f4-4f3b-85c9-4c0717d0f577"
id="def.officeroftheCommonwealth"><b><i>officer of the
Commonwealth</i></b></defterm> has the same meaning as in section 75 (v) of
the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Constitution of the Commonwealth</name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_66a3dd4f-985e-4897-aac8-49675c26ae6e"
id="def.relevantfunction"><b><i>relevant function</i></b></defterm> or
<defterm type="definition" guid="_eb73dc26-f249-4e56-8438-9c84c2e025cf"
id="def.power"><b><i>power</i></b></defterm> means a function or power
referred to in paragraph (a) of the definition of <defterm type="definition"
guid="_efbf3dc0-b771-4c72-a46d-ce5467b46573"
id="def.invalidadministrativeaction-oc.2"><b><i>invalid administrative
action</i></b></defterm>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_70fc9568-3de2-4f2c-a0b2-71ab5074a78b"
id="def.relevantStateAct"><b><i>relevant State Act</i></b></defterm>
means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_968f9c3c-c474-4226-a398-25b1f9e9a5d9" id="sec.3-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1990-083" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Corporations (New South
Wales) Act 1990</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_39c026a9-31a9-42dc-8da1-15e3e032ce89" id="sec.3-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1981-122" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Companies (Application of
Laws) Act 1981</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ed7ccc3f-72d7-4131-bfea-92fe61c22f50" id="sec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1981-062" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Companies (Acquisition of
Shares) (Application of Laws) Act 1981</i></name></legref>,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a9d10485-e75c-45d3-9c82-66af5098eacb" id="sec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1981-061" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Securities Industry
(Application of Laws) Act 1981</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3de5bf45-2641-4f75-bd6d-c7a5ae987334" id="sec.3-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1986-066" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Futures Industry
(Application of Laws) Act 1986</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_77f25d0d-44a0-4bfb-a3b8-a57543d7ba07" id="sec.3-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1981-063" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Companies and Securities
(Interpretation and Miscellaneous Provisions) (Application of Laws) Act
1981</i></name></legref>,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">and includes any law applying as a law of the State by
force of any such Act.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_19460898-dd7b-446d-a970-3c6d80b333fa"
id="def.right"><b><i>right</i></b></defterm> includes an interest or
status.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 2016 No 27,
Sch 2.10; 2023 No 7, Sch 2.12.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4a574d7d-bdc5-4d84-9b2d-484640737fb1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_2c40ea64-55b8-486f-b63d-502735281f12"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Application and operation of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_73154371-7b8e-4964-bc43-17f94d199604"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c631d69-a7f3-4775-a963-cf5c46ae3ed7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act has effect despite any provision of the
<legref refid="act-1990-083" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Corporations (New South Wales) Act 1990</i></name></legref>
or of the applicable provisions (as defined in that Act) of the
State.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a14ab495-3eef-4fee-8ee9-fca799c70e3c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsection (4), this Act extends to
rights or liabilities arising between parties to proceedings initiated at or
before the commencement time where an allegedly invalid administrative action
is or was the subject of or relevant to the proceedings.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0206e948-d902-4452-8210-95ab79c9fde8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not affect rights or liabilities
arising between parties to proceedings heard and finally determined at or
before the commencement time to the extent to which those rights or
liabilities arise from, or are affected by, an invalid administrative
action.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_714d2139-2a34-4a1e-a86e-14351ac43661"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_5a823a97-c253-4837-9e94-41f8125a2000"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Legal effect of invalid administrative
actions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Every invalid administrative action has, and is
deemed always to have had, the same force and effect for all purposes as it
would have had if&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_340b5c26-fd0b-4f93-9636-548363818ed7" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">it had been taken, or purportedly taken, by a
State authority or officer of the State, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b0db974a-d3dc-4cfe-9a31-09122719ab9a" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the relevant function or power had been duly
conferred on that authority or officer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_74cad77b-7586-4c20-8bf5-b8f96ff84157"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_6e4e565e-28a3-4aa7-bd90-4b380a6f084e"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Rights and liabilities declared in certain
cases</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4b1e5bcf-aca0-49dc-8e35-0abc17e0edec"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without affecting the generality of section 5,
the rights and liabilities of all persons are, by force of this Act, declared
to be, and always to have been, for all purposes the same as if&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fa466ec1-537e-40aa-bd0b-3db60c471a9d" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">every invalid administrative action had been
taken, or purportedly taken, by a State authority or officer of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_926ebb8e-5136-435e-80f9-b36c06a1983d" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the relevant function or power had been duly
conferred on that authority or officer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5a31950a-c376-4bf8-9f0e-f8cba96f3354"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A right or liability conferred or affected by
subsection (1)&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fa54fd97-e911-455c-8e7e-c3cd8e3c7074" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is exercisable or enforceable,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9351ba01-2dc9-446f-891b-9b3a9b5e1ca8" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is to be regarded as always having been
exercisable or enforceable,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">as if it were a right or liability conferred or affected
by (or arising from) an administrative action of a State authority or officer
of the State on which or whom the relevant function or power had been duly
conferred.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc903f65-ce64-4b05-962e-17f8d026e384"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any act or thing done or omitted to be done at or
before the commencement time under or in relation to a right or liability
conferred or affected by subsection (1)&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_24b803e1-6267-400f-bd2c-7333a8242240" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">has the same effect, and gives rise to the same
consequences, for the purposes of any written or other law,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_51d180d1-805e-409f-9db5-d32393ba7825" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is to be regarded as always having had the same
effect, and given rise to the same consequences, for the purposes of any
written or other law,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">as if it were done, or omitted to be done, to give
effect to, or under the authority of, or in reliance on, an administrative
action of a State authority or officer of the State on which or whom the
relevant function or power had been duly conferred.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a3f76bf3-ee03-4d52-8d37-46f6040e20c3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_1a8e7da3-e565-4600-a74a-2259ee2d4e26"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Registration or incorporation of
companies</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without affecting the generality of sections 5
and 6, it is declared that those sections extend to the registration or
incorporation, or purported registration or incorporation, of companies by, or
consequent on administrative action taken or purportedly taken by,
Commonwealth authorities or officers of the Commonwealth at or before the
commencement time.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2e4e80e4-b06d-4028-afb6-9dcd604e6996"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_6b69cf46-70ef-4577-8677-bb80a165fbb1"
id="sec.8-he"><b>This Act to apply to administrative actions as purportedly in
force from time to time</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0be7c568-5229-42ae-90e4-e3c7e1264517"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of this section is to ensure that
this Act operates to give to an invalid administrative action that has
subsequently been affected by another action or process no greater effect than
it would have had if the administrative action, or any other relevant
administrative action, had not been invalid on constitutional grounds (arising
from the circumstances referred to in paragraphs (a) and (b) of the definition
of <defterm type="definition" guid="_169df9ae-9bb3-42af-a5f4-2775d43f6526"
id="sec.8-def.invalidadministrativeaction"><b><i>invalid administrative
action</i></b></defterm> in section 3).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_41a11142-ce00-4d3a-9797-5351ae8ee39d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If administrative action taken by a Commonwealth
authority or an officer of the Commonwealth was affected (whether by way of
revocation, modification or otherwise) at or before the commencement time by
any later administrative action or by any judicial process or by any
administrative review process, this Act applies to the administrative action
as so affected from time to time.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_71b8755a-ef44-4584-af8f-bd6a7b8b5bf7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, a reference to administrative
action taken includes a reference to administrative action purportedly taken,
and a reference to administrative action affected in any way includes a
reference to administrative action purportedly affected in that
way.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_22dcd589-89bb-4aba-80d6-2d368bcefbf1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_9880d76a-851a-4e07-bd77-7f9e593389d7"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Corresponding authorities or officers</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is immaterial, for the purposes of this Act,
that a Commonwealth authority or an officer of the Commonwealth does not have
a counterpart in the State, or that the powers and functions of a counterpart
State authority or a counterpart officer of the State do not correspond
exactly or substantially with those of the Commonwealth authority or the
officer of the Commonwealth.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_692da598-1384-4817-9c63-a58d8036bd9a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_2fdb3a00-3a98-48cb-b333-dcefe8b36c61"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Act not to give rise to liability against the
State</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8a2f5285-01fd-4734-af40-042143c5de50"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The State is not liable to any action, liability,
claim or demand arising from the enactment, commencement or operation of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_97fed1bb-54e1-411d-bfe4-2c85b9d2e8d1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), no proceedings
lie against the State in respect of an administrative action affected by this
Act, except to the extent that the proceedings would lie had this Act not been
enacted.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a2fe32db-ba42-4668-974f-fd9c43ff5c3e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a845ed25-bcb3-4755-8ed4-93a8ea967ddd"
id="sec.10-def.proceedings"><b><i>proceedings</i></b></defterm> includes
proceedings for an order in the nature of prohibition, certiorari or mandamus
or for a declaration or injunction or for any other relief.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5a9c6ed6-c3c4-465a-a724-f92a8bc543cc"
id="sec.10-def.theState"><b><i>the State</i></b></defterm> includes any State
authority or officer of the State, and also includes&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d31384db-3189-4b5e-989f-ea47ae54c600" id="sec.10-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Crown in right of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_86e1353e-6243-46f8-bc1f-a63498560b91" id="sec.10-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Government of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b3bfaf69-ffa7-4fff-8e68-e866a113bed4" id="sec.10-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a Minister of the Crown in right of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e6e9dbd5-7f65-4185-887f-18ca162e494e" id="sec.10-ssec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a statutory corporation, or other body,
representing the Crown in right of the State.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>
</level>
</content>


